{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.S5SO3FiberAction","lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BringFiberActionInstance","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Rat","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":36,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.colorSheet_fiber_rotation_angle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.colorSheet_fiber_rotation_angle","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L195-L202","doc":"**The color-sheet fiber rotation is the icosahedral Reeb phase.**  Under\nthe discharged `bringFiberAction_icosahedral` instance, the T₁ (color\nsheet) fiber rotation angle is pinned to `arccos((1+√5)/6) = arccos(φ/3)`\n— the concrete SO(3)-fiber datum over Bring that the conjectural weight\ntensor `W_{c₁c₂}` must derive from. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.color_sheets_carry_T1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.color_sheets_carry_T1","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L184-L193","doc":"**Color sheets carry the T₁ irrep.**  The three color sheets are the\nbasis of the 3-dimensional icosahedral irrep T₁ — the ℓ = 1 Hopf\ngeneration selection (`hopfGenerationSelect 1 = T₁`,\n`icosBranchingMult 1 = V₁ = T₁`).  This is the derivable half of the\n\"weight tensor from SO(3)-fiber data\" wiring: the fiber datum the tensor\nmust be built from is the T₁ block of the discharged fiber action. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.uniformColorTubeData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.uniformColorTubeData","kind":"def","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L168-L180","doc":"**Satisfiability witness — deliberately NOT an instance.**  The\nuniform-flavor projection `W = 1/9` satisfies the class shape (the block's\n§\"Uniform-flavor projection\": it recovers the current production\nassignment).  It is not registered as an instance because it is exactly\nthe flavor-only collapse the conjecture identifies as missing the\nload-bearing per-arc structure (the sign-flip diagnostic's R² = 0.83\narc-count correlation); registering it would dishonestly \"discharge\" the\nconjecture with the very projection it refines. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.uniformWeight_normalized","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.uniformWeight_normalized","kind":"theorem","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L162-L166","doc":"The uniform weights are normalised. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.uniformWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.uniformWeight","kind":"def","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L159-L160","doc":"The uniform color-pair weight `W_{c₁c₂} = 1/9`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.weight_normalized","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.weight_normalized","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L154-L154","doc":"Normalisation: the 9 color-pair weights sum to 1 for each flavor pair\n(the refined generator is a categorical average). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.weight_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.weight_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L151-L151","doc":"Weights are nonnegative (`W ∈ ℚ≥0` per the block statement). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.weight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.weight","kind":"def","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L149-L149","doc":"The categorical weight of a color-sheet pair given the source/target\nnucleon flavor content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube.mk","kind":"ctor","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L146-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.InterNucleonChannelColorTube","kind":"class","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L129-L155","doc":"**CONJECTURE (§3b-cond class).** Inter-nucleon Hecke channel assignment\nfrom Bring color-tube weighting: the canonical color-pair weight tensor\n`W_{c₁c₂}(F₁, F₂) ∈ ℚ≥0`, normalised to `Σ_{c₁c₂} W = 1` per flavor pair,\nso the refined generator `σ^(F₁,F₂) = Σ W_{c₁c₂} σ^{ε(c₁,c₂,F₁,F₂)}` is a\ncategorical average over the 9 color-sheet pairs.\n\nThe `[BringFiberAction]` binder records the conditional structure of the\nblock (\"conditional on `conj:s5-so3-fiber-action`\"); that supplier class\nis now discharged by the icosahedral Reeb instance\n(`bringFiberAction_icosahedral`).  The remaining open content — the\nclosed form of `W` as a tensor in the SO(3)-fiber data over Bring, with\nno residual degrees of freedom — is exactly what an instance of this\nclass must supply.  No global instance is provided: the uniform-flavor\nprojection `uniformColorTubeData` below witnesses satisfiability but is\ndeliberately not registered, because it is the flavor-only collapse the\nconjecture identifies as missing the per-arc structure. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:inter-nucleon-channel-color-tube","label":"conj:inter-nucleon-channel-color-tube","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/inter-nucleon-channel-color-tube.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.chiralitySign_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.chiralitySign_mem","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L120-L125","doc":"ε takes values in {+1, −1, 0}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.chiralitySign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.chiralitySign","kind":"def","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L108-L118","doc":"The chirality sign `ε(c₁, c₂, F₁, F₂)` of a color-sheet pair, exactly as\nstated in `conj:inter-nucleon-channel-color-tube` §\"The conjectural\nrefinement\": +1 when the flavors at the contact match (matter–matter),\n−1 when they are flavor-conjugate (matter–antimatter), 0 otherwise\n(mixed-flavor pairs that average to `σ_avg`).  The *derivation* of this\nrule from the S₅-orbit / CPT structure is the block's open question 2;\nthe rule itself is the conjecture's stated data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.colorPairs_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.colorPairs_length","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L103-L104","doc":"All 9 color pairs are listed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.colorPairs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.colorPairs","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L97-L101","doc":"The 9 color-sheet pairs `(c₁, c₂) ∈ {r,g,b}²` of an inter-nucleon arc. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.flavorAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent.flavorAt","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L89-L93","doc":"The flavor a nucleon carries on a given color sheet. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.neutron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.neutron","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L86-L87","doc":"Neutron color content (u, d, d). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.proton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.proton","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L83-L84","doc":"Proton color content (u, u, d). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.NucleonColorContent","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L79-L81","doc":"A nucleon's color-sheet content: the flavor carried on each of the three\ncolor sheets (r, g, b order). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.conj_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.conj_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L75-L77","doc":"Flavor conjugation is an involution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.conj","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L68-L73","doc":"Flavor conjugation u ↔ ū, d ↔ d̄ (the D6 C-action on a single sheet). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprQuarkFlavor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprQuarkFlavor","kind":"instance","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprQuarkFlavor.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprQuarkFlavor.repr","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instDecidableEqQuarkFlavor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instDecidableEqQuarkFlavor","kind":"instance","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L66-L66","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.dbar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.dbar","kind":"ctor","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.ubar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.ubar","kind":"ctor","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.d","kind":"ctor","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.u","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor.u","kind":"ctor","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QuarkFlavor","kind":"inductive","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L61-L66","doc":"Quark flavor including the antimatter conjugates (u, d, ū, d̄).\nThe matter/antimatter doubling is what the D6 charge-conjugation\nconjecture (`conj:c-from-color-flavor-swap`) acts on. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.allList","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.allList","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L58-L59","doc":"The three color sheets. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprColorSheet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprColorSheet","kind":"instance","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprColorSheet.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instReprColorSheet.repr","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instDecidableEqColorSheet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instDecidableEqColorSheet","kind":"instance","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.b","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.g","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.g","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.r","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet.r","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.ColorSheet","kind":"inductive","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/InterNucleonChannelColorTube.lean#L53-L56","doc":"Color-sheet label r/g/b of a nucleon's three quark color sheets. ","signatureChunk":0}]}